v 40 30 0.5
v 40 5 0.5
v 20 5 0.5
vt 0 1
vt 1 1
vt 1 0
vt 0 0
vn 0 0 1
usemtl cloth_mtl
f 25/1/3 26/2/3 27/3/3
f 25/1/3 27/3/3 28/4/3

